  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Budget Adjustments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adjustments are required to reconcile expenses to ODA, which is reported on a cash basis. These adjustments include: prior year cash returned after the finalisation of an agreement or funding arrangement originally paid in a previous financial year, accrual adjustments to adjust expenses to a cash basis and repayment of loans prior to the grant equivalent system being adopted (2018).&#xa0;The amount is presented as a negative ODA cash flow.</narrative>
  </description>
